    "body": "I'm working on this issue.\r\nI'm trying to extend `starship/src/configs/battery.rs` configuration and add a symbol option.\r\nLike below.\r\n```rust\r\n#[derive(Clone, ModuleConfig)]\r\npub struct BatteryDisplayConfig<'a> {\r\n    pub threshold: i64,\r\n    pub style: &'a str,\r\n    pub symbol: &'a str,\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen I set the symbol option, the code seems to work.\r\n```toml\r\n[[battery.display]]\r\nthreshold = 100\r\nstyle = \"bold green\"\r\nsymbol = \"test\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever, if the symbol option is not set, `battery.display` option is not reflected at all.\r\n(Not only `symbol` option, but also `threshold` and `style` option)\r\n```toml\r\n[[battery.display]]\r\nthreshold = 100\r\nstyle = \"bold green\"\r\n# symbol = \"test\" <- comment out\r\n```\r\n\r\nI think the symbol option should be optional.\r\nDoes anyone know how to make it optional?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
