    "updated_at": "2021-03-09T08:51:26Z",
    "body": "the `battery.display` is a vector where you can set different styles for different range of battery percentage.\r\nThe default config only comes with the configuration for percentage <= 10%. \r\n\r\nYou can add the following config to make the battery status alway visible, the `symbol` is not required\r\n\r\n```\r\n[[battery.display]]\r\nthreshold = 100\r\nstyle = \"bold green\"\r\n```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
